\* All TLC check configs for AntflyLitePublication.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyLitePublication.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyManifestBeforeArtifacts = FALSE
    BuggyFailedPublicationAdvancesHead = FALSE
    BuggyCleanupPinnedReader = FALSE
    BuggyMixedVisibleGeneration = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    ManifestReferencesPublishedArtifacts
    VisibleManifestReferencesPublishedArtifacts
    ReaderGenerationIsPinnedAndConsistent
    FailedPublicationCannotAdvanceVisibleGeneration
    CleanupCannotDeleteReaderPinnedGeneration
    HeadNeverExceedsStoredManifest
    Safety

==== BadFailedHead
\* Expected-failure config: a failed publication advances the visible head.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyManifestBeforeArtifacts = FALSE
    BuggyFailedPublicationAdvancesHead = TRUE
    BuggyCleanupPinnedReader = FALSE
    BuggyMixedVisibleGeneration = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    FailedPublicationCannotAdvanceVisibleGeneration
    Safety

==== BadManifestBeforeArtifacts
\* Expected-failure config: a manifest references artifact generation data
\* before the artifacts have all been published.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyManifestBeforeArtifacts = TRUE
    BuggyFailedPublicationAdvancesHead = FALSE
    BuggyCleanupPinnedReader = FALSE
    BuggyMixedVisibleGeneration = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    ManifestReferencesPublishedArtifacts
    Safety

==== BadMixedGeneration
\* Expected-failure config: visible manifest references mix artifacts from the
\* new generation and the previous head generation.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyManifestBeforeArtifacts = FALSE
    BuggyFailedPublicationAdvancesHead = FALSE
    BuggyCleanupPinnedReader = FALSE
    BuggyMixedVisibleGeneration = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    VisibleManifestReferencesPublishedArtifacts
    ReaderGenerationIsPinnedAndConsistent
    Safety

==== BadPinnedCleanup
\* Expected-failure config: cleanup deletes generation data pinned by an active
\* reader/query session.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyManifestBeforeArtifacts = FALSE
    BuggyFailedPublicationAdvancesHead = FALSE
    BuggyCleanupPinnedReader = TRUE
    BuggyMixedVisibleGeneration = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    CleanupCannotDeleteReaderPinnedGeneration
    Safety
